  "title": "Carrot Spice and Walnut Pie",
  "description": "Pureed baby carrots are spiced and mixed with honey, nuts, butter, eggs and lots of sugar. This lovely, sweet concoction is then spooned into a pastry shell and baked for about an hour. Serve this wonderful pie warm with whipped cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Deborah Cornette"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-11-23T03:25:59-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2022-08-08T10:47:58-04:00",
